                <pb facs="0147" n="45" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg45"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.79614/–: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Geissler</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-01T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>7. Legation’s despatch No. 1391, dated January 19. Department desires that you
                    discreetly ascertain who is backing Parada financially.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
